          "title": "Reading Israeli phone numbers",
          "items": [
            "Israeli numbers always start with **אֶפֶס** (zero): 050, 052, 054 for mobiles; 02 Jerusalem, 03 Tel Aviv, 04 Haifa, 08 the south, 09 the Sharon.",
